Full selected-owner identity detects the three earlier body changes missed by normalized AST vectors while retaining comments/unselected edits in12 frozen controls (7identity matches/5differences). Two further controls preserve those complete owner identities while changing outside binding authority: Cobra's formatter can returnnil; Zod's failure function can be reassigned. These controls were parsed, never executed/typechecked. All fail the original full-source identity. No T reference hash changed and no new revision was semantically admitted. Identity is useful invalidation evidence, not semantic proof.

Actual single-file publication research used15 frozen single-worker cases plus two competing publishers. The unchanged own workspace library publishes an empty/partial final name under before/midwrite stops; an isolated staged-file/fsync/no-overwrite-hardlink profile keeps the final name absent until full publication. Existing file/symlink targets were retained, one of two racing bodies won, and both stages were preserved. No production fix, automatic orphan cleanup, helper replay, job-budget reset, power-loss test, Windows test or native neural checkpoint recovery occurred. Multi-file job reconciliation remains unresolved. Historical archives preserve bytes/modes, not hardlink inode aliasing; a separate receipt preserves the four observed alias groups.

The protocol/exposure audit binds all98 terminal inference requests to14 preprediction protocols and exact request hashes:31Cobra,39FastAPI,28Zod, all development-exposed/training-excluded. Their local freeze timestamps precede starts; this is local provenance, not trusted timestamp attestation. Independent Git-blob checking confirms all69 selected public clone-file SHA256 values across14 repositories. Current model tag/digest remains the same GGUFQ4_K_M; the observed Python interpreter still discovers none of six native training packages. No new neural call was made for these closing research observations.

Paired tradeoff audit: reversing user alternatives corrects F01/F04/F05, regresses F06 and changes two still-wrong choices, giving six changed selections and3/9→5/9, still no whole note. Schema-only reversal changes none. M question repair fixes C01/C04 pair classes but regresses C05; net pair classification and full-reference coverage use different units. These are fixed exposed-case effects, not independent trials, weight gains or internal-cause proof.

Requirement auditv1 covers53 explicit checkpoints:48 research items addressed with limits; final time, canonical-report cut, inventory/recovery and final-response format remain pending. Current metric catalogv4, production proposalsv6 and readinessv7 supersede earlier catalogs only; all original evidence is retained.


